#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the managed workflows client package, authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform, and verify your setup."
msgstr "Installe le package client des flux de travail gérés, authentifie-toi auprès d'IBM Quantum Platform et vérifie ta configuration."

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {#install}"
msgstr "Installation {#install}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prérequis {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows enabled on your [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contact your administrator to enable it.\n"
msgstr "Flux de travail gérés activés sur tes [instances IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contacte ton administrateur pour l'activer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An API key and the CRN of your instance. See [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Une clé API et le CRN de ton instance. Consulte [Trouver tes identifiants d'accès](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later, in an active virtual environment. See [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) for how to set up an environment.\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 ou version ultérieure, dans un environnement virtuel actif. Consulte [Installer Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) pour savoir comment configurer un environnement.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start with AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Démarrage rapide avec les compétences IA {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the AI skills in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) to help you install `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, package your existing local code, and deploy it as a managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux utiliser les compétences IA du [dépôt de modèles Qiskit Function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) pour t'aider à installer `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, à empaqueter ton code local existant et à le déployer sous forme de flux de travail géré.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the client package {#install-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Installer le package client {#install-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the `qiskit-ibm-catalog` package:\n"
msgstr "Installe le package `qiskit-ibm-catalog` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command also installs `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` as dependencies. You do not need to install `qiskit-serverless` separately. The examples in these guides require `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 or later, which installs `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"
msgstr "Cette commande installe aussi `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit` et `qiskit-ibm-runtime` comme dépendances. Tu n'as pas besoin d'installer `qiskit-serverless` séparément. Les exemples de ces guides nécessitent `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 ou version ultérieure, qui installe `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 et `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use two of these packages directly, in different places:\n"
msgstr "Tu utilises directement deux de ces packages, à des endroits différents :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` is the client that you use on your local computer to upload workflows, run them, and get their results.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` est le client que tu utilises sur ton ordinateur local pour téléverser des flux de travail, les exécuter et obtenir leurs résultats.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-serverless` runs inside your workflow code. It provides helpers such as `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, and `save_result()`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-serverless` s'exécute dans le code de ton flux de travail. Il fournit des utilitaires tels que `get_arguments()`, `update_status()` et `save_result()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the client package {#update-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Mettre à jour le package client {#update-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because managed workflows is in beta, the client package changes often. To check which version you have, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Comme les flux de travail gérés sont en bêta, le package client change souvent. Pour vérifier quelle version tu as, exécute la commande suivante :\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or, in Python:\n"
msgstr "Or, in Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update to the latest version, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Pour passer à la dernière version, exécute la commande suivante :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the new version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requires a newer version of `qiskit-serverless`, this command also updates `qiskit-serverless`.\n"
msgstr "Si la nouvelle version de `qiskit-ibm-catalog` nécessite une version plus récente de `qiskit-serverless`, cette commande met aussi à jour `qiskit-serverless`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate {#authenticate}"
msgstr "S'authentifier {#authenticate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"Do not include your API key in your workflow code, in scripts, or in notebook files. A running workflow uses the credentials and instance that you used to call `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protège ta clé API\">\n"
"N'inclus pas ta clé API dans le code de ton flux de travail, dans des scripts ou dans des fichiers notebook. Un flux de travail en cours d'exécution utilise les identifiants et l'instance que tu as utilisés pour appeler `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The managed workflows client uses the same credentials as `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. If you already saved an account with `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, the client loads your default saved account, and you can skip to [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"
msgstr "Le client des flux de travail gérés utilise les mêmes identifiants que `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Si tu as déjà enregistré un compte avec `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, le client charge ton compte enregistré par défaut, et tu peux passer directement à [Vérifier ta configuration](#verify-your-setup).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not saved an account, save your API key and instance CRN one time in a trusted environment:\n"
msgstr "Si tu n'as pas enregistré de compte, enregistre ta clé API et le CRN de ton instance une seule fois, dans un environnement de confiance :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method writes your credentials to the same file as [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). The client uses the `ibm_quantum_platform` channel by default, so you do not need to set `channel`. To save more than one account, set `name`, and pass the same `name` when you create the client.\n"
msgstr "Cette méthode écrit tes identifiants dans le même fichier que [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). Le client utilise par défaut le canal `ibm_quantum_platform`, tu n'as donc pas besoin de définir `channel`. Pour enregistrer plusieurs comptes, définis `name`, et passe le même `name` quand tu crées le client.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more options, such as saving several accounts or selecting an instance automatically, see [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). If you work on a public computer or another untrusted environment, do not save your credentials. Instead, follow [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
msgstr "Pour plus d'options, comme l'enregistrement de plusieurs comptes ou la sélection automatique d'une instance, consulte [Enregistrer tes identifiants de connexion](/guides/save-credentials). Si tu travailles sur un ordinateur public ou dans un autre environnement non fiable, n'enregistre pas tes identifiants. Suis plutôt [Initialiser le service dans un environnement non fiable](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your setup {#verify-your-setup}"
msgstr "Vérifier ta configuration {#verify-your-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to managed workflows with your saved account, and list the workflows that you uploaded:\n"
msgstr "Connecte-toi aux workflows gérés avec ton compte enregistré, puis liste les workflows que tu as téléversés :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not uploaded a workflow yet, the output is an empty list (`[]`). If you see an authentication error, the client did not find valid credentials. Check the account that you saved in the [Authenticate](#authenticate) section.\n"
msgstr "Si tu n'as pas encore téléversé de workflow, la sortie est une liste vide (`[]`). Si tu vois une erreur d'authentification, le client n'a pas trouvé d'identifiants valides. Vérifie le compte que tu as enregistré dans la section [Authenticate](#authenticate).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Étapes suivantes {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) to upload a workflow, run it, and get its result.\n"
"- To start from working code, deploy one of the [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), or adapt a base template for your own workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandations\">\n"
"- [Déploie ton premier workflow géré](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) pour téléverser un workflow, l'exécuter et obtenir son résultat.\n"
"- Pour partir d'un code fonctionnel, déploie l'un des [modèles de Qiskit Function](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), ou adapte un modèle de base à ton propre workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
